---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import DocsPreview from "../../../components/DocsPreview.astro";
import DocsSidebar from "../../../components/DocsSidebar.astro";
import DocsTOC from "../../../components/DocsTOC.astro";
import DocsPagination from "../../../components/DocsPagination.astro";
import CodeWindow from "../../../components/CodeWindow.astro";
import "../../../styles/docs.css";
---

<Layout title="Tilt Card — Recipes — Motion Components" description="A card that tilts in 3D following the cursor, with a spotlight overlay and hover lift. Three primitives composed for a premium card interaction." noMain>
  <div class="layout">
    <DocsSidebar />

    <main>
      <h1>Tilt Card</h1>
      <p class="lead">A card that tilts in 3D following the cursor, with a spotlight overlay and hover lift. The kind of interaction you see on premium landing pages.</p>

      <h2>Preview</h2>
      <DocsPreview wide>
        <div class="tilt-demo">
          <motion-tilt max="15" scale="1.02">
            <motion-spotlight size="300" color="rgba(96,165,250,0.15)">
              <div class="tilt-card">
                <div class="card-icon">✦</div>
                <h3>Analytics</h3>
                <p>Real-time insights into your product usage, conversion funnels, and user behavior.</p>
              </div>
            </motion-spotlight>
          </motion-tilt>
        </div>
      </DocsPreview>

      <h2>Complete code</h2>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="tilt-card.html"
        copy
        code={`<motion-tilt max="15" scale="1.02">
  <motion-spotlight size="300" color="rgba(96,165,250,0.15)">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-icon">✦</div>
      <h3>Analytics</h3>
      <p>Real-time insights into your product usage.</p>
    </div>
  </motion-spotlight>
</motion-tilt>`}
      />

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Two interaction primitives layered on a static card. The tilt handles 3D rotation, the spotlight adds a tracking light effect.</p>

      <h3>3D tilt</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="tilt.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-tilt max="15" scale="1.02">
  <!-- rotates along X/Y based on cursor position -->
</motion-tilt>`}
      />
      <p class="section-lead"><code>max</code> is the maximum rotation in degrees. At <code>15</code> the card tilts up to 15 degrees toward the cursor. The <code>scale</code> lifts it slightly on hover for a floating feel.</p>

      <h3>Spotlight overlay</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="spotlight.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-spotlight size="300" color="rgba(96,165,250,0.15)">
  <!-- radial gradient tracks the cursor -->
</motion-spotlight>`}
      />
      <p class="section-lead">The spotlight renders a radial gradient that follows the cursor with a lerped lag. It fades in on hover and out on leave. The <code>smoothing</code> attribute (default 0.18) controls how much the light lags behind the cursor.</p>

      <h2>Tuning</h2>

      <h3>Subtle</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="subtle.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-tilt max="8" scale="1.01">
  <motion-spotlight size="250" color="rgba(255,255,255,0.06)">
    <div class="card">...</div>
  </motion-spotlight>
</motion-tilt>`}
      />

      <h3>Dramatic</h3>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="dramatic.html"
        copy
        compact
        code={`<motion-tilt max="20" scale="1.04" gloss>
  <motion-spotlight size="400" color="rgba(96,165,250,0.25)">
    <div class="card">...</div>
  </motion-spotlight>
</motion-tilt>`}
      />
      <p class="section-lead">Add <code>gloss</code> to motion-tilt for a moving specular highlight across the card surface.</p>

      <h2>Card styles</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">The card itself is just CSS. The motion components wrap it without modifying its structure.</p>
      <CodeWindow
        filename="card.css"
        copy
        compact
        code={`.card {
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 2rem;
  width: 320px;
  min-height: 200px;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
}`}
      />

      <h2>Accessibility</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Both components respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>. The tilt settles to a flat position and the spotlight stays hidden. The card remains fully readable without any motion.</p>

      <DocsPagination />
    </main>
    <DocsTOC />
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  import "motion-components";
</script>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .section-lead {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-lead code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono), monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-dim);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .tilt-demo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .tilt-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    width: 300px;
    min-height: 200px;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    position: relative;
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tilt-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tilt-card p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
